      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "飢えって奴は嫌だよねえ。家族は皆それで死んだ。\nだから覚えたのさ。飛ぶ鳥を落とし、食らう技を。\n鳥は素早いけど。オレは逃がしたことはない。\n人間はどうかねえ？　ちょっと試させておくれよ。",
        "official_en": "Nothing is crueler than starvation. Took my whole\nfamily, it did. So I devised a technique to drop birds\nright out of the sky, so I could eat 'em. They're fast.\nFaster than men. Let's see how fast you are.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
